stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> NORMAL

    NORMAL --> SHED_AI : shared-capacity saturation, or the per-tenant AI budget breached
    SHED_AI --> SHED_ANALYTICS : saturation persists
    SHED_ANALYTICS --> SHED_NONCRITICAL_WRITES : saturation persists
    SHED_NONCRITICAL_WRITES --> PROTECT_STATUTORY : saturation persists, or a dependency failure confined to non-statutory services
    PROTECT_STATUTORY --> READ_ONLY : data-layer failure, or an integrity signal from NFR-SEC-405 BROKEN
    READ_ONLY --> EXPORT_ONLY : primary region failure before failover completes

    SHED_AI --> NORMAL : signal clear for a sustained interval
    SHED_ANALYTICS --> SHED_AI : signal clear for a sustained interval
    SHED_NONCRITICAL_WRITES --> SHED_ANALYTICS : signal clear for a sustained interval
    PROTECT_STATUTORY --> SHED_NONCRITICAL_WRITES : signal clear, and a reliability review is scheduled regardless
    READ_ONLY --> PROTECT_STATUTORY : root cause addressed
    EXPORT_ONLY --> READ_ONLY : failover complete

    state NORMAL {
        [*] --> everything_available
    }
    state PROTECT_STATUTORY {
        [*] --> pay_run_compute
        pay_run_compute --> approval_and_lock
        approval_and_lock --> bank_file
        bank_file --> statutory_artefact_generation_and_export
    }
    state EXPORT_ONLY {
        [*] --> download_of_already_generated_artefacts_and_registers
    }

    note right of NORMAL
      Four invariants, each a test in 17.18.
      1. Descent may be automatic. Ascent needs the signal clear for a sustained
         interval, so a flapping dependency cannot oscillate the estate.
      2. No rung drops a committed payroll transaction. The section 08 payroll-month
         states are the checkpoint boundaries - a run interrupted at PROCESSED
         resumes at PROCESSED.
      3. At PROTECT_STATUTORY and below no number changes. Degradation removes
         features. It never substitutes an approximate, cached or model-generated
         figure. The determinism invariant holds at every rung.
      4. Every rung is visible - a tenant banner and, at P1, the status page.
         A degraded system that looks healthy destroys trust faster than an outage
         that says so.
    end note
